            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="Where the distances of the rulec corpus rule osha_extinguisher.rule come from: 29 CFR 1910.157(d), borrowed from the copy the rule pins. A test fixture; it does not say how the regulation is to be read">
